### Manual cases: charge a finished turno with Mercado Pago and confirm the payment.
### Web: JWT + admin (the seller is the logged-in user, who must have linked Mercado Pago).
### Bot: x-api-key + the phone of an admin user. Migration 013 must be applied.
@base = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = PASTE_JWT_HERE
@botKey = PASTE_BOT_API_KEY_HERE
@telefono = PASTE_ADMIN_PHONE_HERE
@idTurno = PASTE_ID_OF_A_REALIZADO_TURNO
@idCobro = PASTE_ID_FROM_STEP_1

### 1) Get or create the payment link of a turno  -  [Expect 201, data.init_point, data.monto = what the client still owes]
POST {{base}}/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_turno": {{idTurno}} }

### 2) Same request again while the link is valid  -  [Expect 201 and the SAME cobro id]
POST {{base}}/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_turno": {{idTurno}} }

### 3) Turno that is not Realizado  -  [Expect 409, "tiene que estar Realizado"]
POST {{base}}/cobros
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id_turno": 1 }

### 4) QR image of the link  -  [Expect 200 image/png]
GET {{base}}/cobros/{{idCobro}}/qr
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) Cobros of a turno  -  [Expect 200, newest first]
GET {{base}}/cobros?id_turno={{idTurno}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Active check against Mercado Pago (the panel polls this)  -  [Expect 200, data.estado / data.impactado, verificado]
###    Pay with a Mercado Pago TEST buyer, then call this: it must turn Aprobado and impactado=true
###    without waiting for the webhook (works from localhost). Mercado Pago is asked at most once per 15 s.
POST {{base}}/cobros/{{idCobro}}/verificar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) Cancel locally  -  [Expect 200, estado Cancelado] (the link keeps working at Mercado Pago until it expires)
POST {{base}}/cobros/{{idCobro}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Bot: QR of the real payment link  -  [Expect 200 image/png, headers X-Cobro-Id / X-Cobro-Monto / X-Cobro-Reutilizado]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/turnos/{{idTurno}}/qr
x-api-key: {{botKey}}

### 9) Bot: "did they pay?"  -  [Expect 200, data.estado, data.impactado, mensaje]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/turnos/{{idTurno}}/cobro
x-api-key: {{botKey}}

### 10) Bot: turno without a cobro  -  [Expect 200, estado "Sin cobro"]
GET {{base}}/bot/staff/{{telefono}}/turnos/999999/cobro
x-api-key: {{botKey}}
